# The GitHub Pages proposal demo needs no environment variables: it runs fully in
# the browser with the offline concierge and on-device data.
#
# Phase 2 (pilot) only. Set these in the hosting provider's dashboard, never in
# this repository and never with a VITE_ prefix for secrets.
#
# Server-side only (serverless function):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# AI_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5          # or claude-sonnet-5-5
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
#
# Safe for the browser (public by design, protected by row-level security):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
